/* Narrow by the panel's width, not the device: with the insert button first, Share and Tag keep their icons
   and the buttons sit closer, so Insert \xB7 Copy \xB7 Share \xB7 Tag \xB7 \u2026 stay on one line at 375 pt in every language. */
